 "painter": "mix",
 "note": "Black obsidian veined with molten gold: OpenAI panels on the whole cue (obsidian twisted with black-chrome ribbons and a molten-gold line, a forearm veined with gold, an engraved grip with gold cracks, a sleeve with gold bands); the collar is obsidian split by glowing cracks between gold bands, the tip's side obsidian with molten cracks, the ferrule a gold corona ring round a black-sun band (themed ends). The 3D piece: a black sun past the butt in a cup of obsidian and gold, two rings of corona spikes turning round it with flare rings, breathing; a moon; four orbit rings along the cue carrying four planets (gold, a ringed ember, ice, violet), two great orbits, twelve asteroids tumbling, and an eclipse-shadow ring that sweeps the cue every five seconds. The aura is a star system, not a cloud: a dark nebula, a far and a near star field, gold dust, a comet now and then, sparks and slow prominences at the sun. The whole cue is wrapped in a blazing gold sheath: a ForceField capsule with a Neon core on the piece, and sleeve sprites locked along the stick, so the Secret shines from across the lobby (designer, 2026-10-04: the glow that first floated over the carrying player's head now masks and wraps the cue).",
